## Codebook Shapefile `netherlands_roman.geojson`

- id: municipality id
- code: GM code, standard municipality identification code
- areaname: name of the municipality
- area_large: area (sq meter) of the municipality
- area_small: area of the part of the municipality that was inside the former Roman empire if it had some overlap. Otherwise NA
- surface_in_emp: % of area that was in former Roman Empire
- in_empire: indicator variable, takes 0 if overlap with RE but less than 0.2, 1 if overlap and > 1, NA otherwise
- distance_from_border: minimum distance (meters) from former Roman Empire border
- geometry: spatial features (polygon)